<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Unfortunately, we are unable to provide overrides for reserved seats.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please hover over the green triangle to the right of the course to see the course reserves, the seats available for each reserve and the reserve release date ("Reserved Until:"). On the release date, you should be able to enroll in any open seat so long as requisites have been met.<br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I apologize for the inconvenience.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Department of Physics</font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div>]]></td>
